# Cloud Build uses this file when archiving the source context. Default-deny so
# browser profiles, ADC files, OAuth downloads, and unrelated workspace files
# can never be uploaded merely because a new filename was not blacklisted.
**
!Dockerfile
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src/
!src/**
src/**/__pycache__/
src/**/*.pyc
src/**/*.pyo
